    "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/829110/extras/8b510b80e3579d8d26db5b9564fb2283.avif?t=1753785375\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's good to be bad\u2026 Get the Deluxe Edition now and gain access to the main game and season pass content. Embark on an all-new DC/LEGO\u00ae adventure by becoming the best villain the universe has seen in LEGO\u00ae DC Super-Villains.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>It's good to be bad\u2026 Embark on an all-new\u00a0DC/LEGO\u00ae adventure by becoming the best villain the universe has seen. Players will create and play as an all-new super-villain throughout the game, unleashing mischievous antics and wreaking havoc in an action-packed story. Set in an open world experience within the DC\u00a0universe, the Justice League has disappeared, leaving Earth's protection to their counterparts, who have proclaimed themselves as the &quot;Justice Syndicate&quot;. It's up to you and a crazy group of misfits to uncover the intentions of Earth's new, strange, wannabe superheroes. Joined by renowned\u00a0DC Super-Villains: The Joker, Harley Quinn, and countless others from the Injustice League, players will set out on an epic adventure.",
    "about_the_game": "It's good to be bad\u2026 Embark on an all-new\u00a0DC/LEGO\u00ae adventure by becoming the best villain the universe has seen. Players will create and play as an all-new super-villain throughout the game, unleashing mischievous antics and wreaking havoc in an action-packed story. Set in an open world experience within the DC\u00a0universe, the Justice League has disappeared, leaving Earth's protection to their counterparts, who have proclaimed themselves as the &quot;Justice Syndicate&quot;. It's up to you and a crazy group of misfits to uncover the intentions of Earth's new, strange, wannabe superheroes. Joined by renowned\u00a0DC Super-Villains: The Joker, Harley Quinn, and countless others from the Injustice League, players will set out on an epic adventure.",
    "short_description": "It's good to be bad\u2026 Embark on an all-new\u00a0DC/LEGO\u00ae adventure by becoming the best villain the universe has seen. Players will create and play as an all-new super-villain throughout the game, unleashing mischievous antics and wreaking havoc in an action-packed story.",
